#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:45
#: d2b15bc308d7495fb8cadce25c80a7ea
msgid ""
"The way it works is the autopilot looks at the roll and/or pitch attitude "
"needed to control the desired position. The basic algorithm is \"yaw into "
"the roll/pitch\". If the aircraft needs hold roll to the right in order to "
"hold position then it will turn in that direction on the assumption that the"
" right roll is needed in order to hold against the wind (assuming nose into "
"the wind). Similarly, for Side Into the Wind, it will use the pitch angle "
"and yaw appropriately, trying to zero the pitch required to hold position."
msgstr ""
"工作方式是飞控查看保持所需位置所需的横滚和/或俯仰姿态。基本算法是「朝横滚/俯仰方向偏航」。如果飞行器需要向右横滚以保持位置，则它将向该方向转向，假设需要向右横滚是为了抵抗风（假设机头迎风）。同样，对于侧面迎风，它将使用俯仰角并适当偏航，尝试将保持位置所需的俯仰降为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:51
#: 3d9c94debed8464db46371d3a6333f17
msgid ""
"by default, weathervaning does not use pitch, only roll. This is to prevent "
"unwanted continuous yawing if the hover attitude has not been trimmed with "
":ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` to hover, in place, with no wind. If this "
"**has** been done, then pitch driven weathervaning can be enabled by setting"
" :ref:`Q_WVANE_OPTIONS<Q_WVANE_OPTIONS>` bit 0 to \"1\". This will speed "
"weathervaning if positioned with the wind blowing from behind (ie mostly "
"being held in position with pitch, not roll). This does not affect Side Into"
" Wind, it always uses pitch, and :ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` must be "
"properly set for good operation."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，风向标效应不使用俯仰，只使用横滚。这是为了防止在悬停姿态未通过 :ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` "
"调整为在无风时原地悬停的情况下，发生不必要的持续偏航。如果 **已经** 完成了此操作，则可以通过将 "
":ref:`Q_WVANE_OPTIONS<Q_WVANE_OPTIONS>` 第 0 "
"位设置为「1」来启用俯仰驱动的风向标效应。这将在风从后方吹来时加速风向标效应（即主要用俯仰而非横滚保持位置时）。这不影响侧面迎风，它始终使用俯仰，:ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>`"
" 必须正确设置才能良好运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:53
#: ca5d9248cbba4b90a7ee543f374390ee
msgid ""
"How quickly the aircraft yaws is determined by the "
":ref:`Q_WVANE_GAIN<Q_WVANE_GAIN>` parameter. It converts the lean angle into"
" degs/sec of yaw. A good value to start with is 1 (1 degree roll = 1 deg/sec"
" yaw if :ref:`Q_PLT_Y_RATE<Q_PLT_Y_RATE>` =90). Higher values for gain or "
"rate will make the aircraft turn into the roll more quickly. If the overall "
"correcting yaw rate is too high then you can get instability and oscillation"
" in yaw."
msgstr ""
"飞行器偏航的速度由 :ref:`Q_WVANE_GAIN<Q_WVANE_GAIN>` 参数确定。它将倾斜角转换为度/秒的偏航速率。良好的起始值为 "
"1（如果 :ref:`Q_PLT_Y_RATE<Q_PLT_Y_RATE>` =90，则 1 度横滚 = 1 "
"度/秒偏航）。更高的增益或速率值将使飞行器更快地转向横滚方向。如果总体修正偏航速率过高，则偏航可能出现不稳定和振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:58
#: 3a44bf8d158540809c7044ac7992f7c6
msgid ""
"To cope with a small amount of trim in the aircraft there is an additional "
"parameter :ref:`Q_WVANE_ANG_MIN<Q_WVANE_ANG_MIN>` which controls the minimum"
" roll/pitch level before weathervaning will be used. This defaults to one "
"degree. If you find your aircraft starts yawing even in no wind then you may"
" need to raise this value."
msgstr ""
"为了应对飞行器的小幅配平，有一个额外的参数 :ref:`Q_WVANE_ANG_MIN<Q_WVANE_ANG_MIN>` "
"控制使用风向标效应的最小横滚/俯仰水平。默认为一度。如果您发现飞行器在无风时也开始偏航，则可能需要提高此值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:64
#: f6476e31cb814f30a82c53d497daf952
msgid ""
"Active weathervaning is only active in VTOL modes, and VTOL sections of AUTO"
" modes (such as VTOL takeoff and VTOL landing). It is not active in "
"QSTABILIZE and QHOVER modes as those are not position controlled modes. It "
"is active is QLOITER, QLAND and QRTL modes."
msgstr ""
"主动风向标效应仅在 VTOL 模式下以及 Auto 模式的 VTOL 部分（如 VTOL 起飞和 VTOL 降落）激活。在 QSTABILIZE 和 "
"QHOVER 模式下不激活，因为这些不是位置控制模式。在 QLOITER、QLAND 和 QRTL 模式下激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:69
#: 6a9fe99dcacc4ae49c7cde3d115d454f
msgid ""
"There are a number of additional parameters that can control when "
"WeatherVaning is active (all are disabled by default):"
msgstr "有许多额外参数可以控制风向标效应的激活时机（所有默认禁用）："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:71
#: f2bdb643b4a446b39c0aeb242fc438a9
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_WVANE_HGT_MIN<Q_WVANE_HGT_MIN>`: above this height weathervaning is "
"permitted"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_WVANE_HGT_MIN<Q_WVANE_HGT_MIN>`：高于此高度时允许风向标效应"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:72
#: 0fa2e164a1e3416fafa84d852162709d
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_WVANE_SPD_MAX<Q_WVANE_SPD_MAX>`: below this ground speed "
"weathervaning is permitted"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_WVANE_SPD_MAX<Q_WVANE_SPD_MAX>`：低于此地速时允许风向标效应"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:73
#: 19117ca52a8a48c981b6df4bd21b6763
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_WVANE_VELZ_MAX<Q_WVANE_VELZ_MAX>`: maximum climb or descent speed at"
" which the vehicle will still attempt to weathervane"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_WVANE_VELZ_MAX<Q_WVANE_VELZ_MAX>`：飞行器仍会尝试进行风向标效应的最大爬升或下降速度"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:74
#: aa16efb87ef0494da34c8cb07ce17083
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_WVANE_TAKEOFF<Q_WVANE_TAKEOFF>`: override weathervaning direction in"
" auto takeoffs*"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_WVANE_TAKEOFF<Q_WVANE_TAKEOFF>`：在自动起飞中覆盖风向标效应方向*"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:75
#: a9a16b72e0814eb7b896a2b9aed87079
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_WVANE_LAND<Q_WVANE_LAND>`: override weathervaning directions in auto"
" landings*"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_WVANE_LAND<Q_WVANE_LAND>`：在自动着陆中覆盖风向标方向*"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:77
#: b769490da49f4685bd1bfc228a4aa106
msgid "note:* not QLOITER take-offs and landings"
msgstr "注意：* 不适用于 QLOITER 起飞和降落"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:79
#: d3eaf37125ad4a84bd596dad763005e2
msgid ""
"Weathervaning can be disabled or enabled by an :ref:`RC Aux Function "
"Switch<common-auxiliary-functions>`, option \"160\""
msgstr "风向标功能可以通过 :ref:`RC 辅助功能开关<common-auxiliary-functions>` 选项\"160\"来禁用或启用"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:82
#: 509ad127dfbb4636bb7fb15b840e4250
msgid "Using the Forward or Tilt Motors to Help Position Holding"
msgstr "使用前向或倾转电机辅助位置保持"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:84
#: 946a49b25c314a78a4906ac4fbea22d0
msgid ""
"In addition to active weathervaning, the QuadPlane code supports using the "
"forward motor or tilting the tilt rotors to hold the pitch level in VTOL "
"flight modes."
msgstr "除主动风向标效应外，四旋翼飞机代码支持在 VTOL 飞行模式中使用前向电机或倾转旋翼来保持俯仰水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:87
#: e543d7986a8f4944b5b2d4fb1e4664eb
msgid ""
"In firmware versions prior to 4.5, to enable use of the forward "
"motor(s)/tilting motors for position hold you need to set the "
":ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN <Q_VFWD_GAIN>` parameter to a non-zero value. This will be"
" active in QLOITER, QRTL, QLAND and in AUTO mode when executing VTOL flight "
"commands.This method uses the velocity controller."
msgstr ""
"在 4.5 之前的固件版本中，要启用使用前向电机/倾转电机进行位置保持，需要将 :ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN <Q_VFWD_GAIN>` "
"参数设置为非零值。这将在 QLOITER、QRTL、QLAND 和 Auto 模式中执行 VTOL 飞行命令时激活。此方法使用速度控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:90
#: 6d4ffc63fae54aadbe4071bfbbfa20e8
msgid ""
"In firmware versions 4.5 and later, use of this mechanism is no longer "
"recommended and has been superseded by a new method which reduces the pitch "
"forward experienced with the method activated using non-zero "
":ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN <Q_VFWD_GAIN>`. This method is enabled by setting "
":ref:`Q_FWD_THR_GAIN<Q_FWD_THR_GAIN>` and "
":ref:`Q_FWD_THR_USE<Q_FWD_THR_USE>` to non-zero values. This newer method "
"uses the position controller to control the forward motor/tilt."
msgstr ""
"在 4.5 及更高版本的固件中，不再推荐使用此机制，已被一种新方法所取代，该新方法减少了使用非零 :ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN "
"<Q_VFWD_GAIN>` 激活的方法所产生的前俯体验。通过将 :ref:`Q_FWD_THR_GAIN<Q_FWD_THR_GAIN>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_FWD_THR_USE<Q_FWD_THR_USE>` 设置为非零值来启用此新方法。此新方法使用位置控制器来控制前向电机/倾转。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:93
#: 9a94762f570444a4bb23ef8fc11b6a22
msgid ""
"Tailsitters do not have these options and :ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN <Q_VFWD_GAIN>`, "
":ref:`Q_FWD_THR_GAIN<Q_FWD_THR_GAIN>` or "
":ref:`Q_FWD_THR_USE<Q_FWD_THR_USE>`, should be kept at the default value of "
"0."
msgstr ""
"尾坐式没有这些选项，:ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN "
"<Q_VFWD_GAIN>`、:ref:`Q_FWD_THR_GAIN<Q_FWD_THR_GAIN>` 或 "
":ref:`Q_FWD_THR_USE<Q_FWD_THR_USE>` 应保持默认值 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:96
#: 719b911341bd4307bed93ab18a9be6eb
msgid "Old Method (Q_VFWD_GAIN)"
msgstr "旧方法（Q_VFWD_GAIN）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:98
#: e30ec7b885ee4b74b47ec8b2e2033b75
msgid "The way it works is to look at two factors:"
msgstr "其工作方式是查看两个因素："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:100
#: 035dd648b1474effa913bb855b7abd33
msgid ""
"the navigation attitude pitch of the aircraft (which can be up to "
":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX<Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>`)"
msgstr "飞机的导航姿态俯仰角（最大可达 :ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX<Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:101
#: 588821f01def4ff593b4dfe8aec7f487
msgid ""
"the difference between the desired forward velocity and the actual forward "
"velocity"
msgstr "期望前向速度与实际前向速度之差"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:104
#: df5c0bb61332422cb6a28de45d293773
msgid ""
"These are combined with the :ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN<Q_VFWD_GAIN>` to ramp up and "
"down the throttle on the forward motor in order to minimize the attitude "
"pitch of the aircraft. That keeps the area of wing exposed to the wind "
"minimized which can reduce VTOL motor load."
msgstr ""
"这两者与 :ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN<Q_VFWD_GAIN>` "
"结合，用于调节前向电机的油门以使飞机的姿态俯仰角最小化。这样可以将机翼暴露在风中的面积降到最低，从而减少 VTOL 电机负荷。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:109
#: a8bf01dcbf8a47dc96bfe0a40caa3105
msgid ""
"A good value to start with for :ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN<Q_VFWD_GAIN>` is 0.05. "
"Higher values will use the forward motor more aggressively. If the value is "
"too high you can get severe pitch oscillations."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_VFWD_GAIN<Q_VFWD_GAIN>` 的初始建议值为 "
"0.05。数值越大，前向电机的使用越激进。若数值过高，可能导致严重的俯仰振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:113
#: 71a41360c8ce439ea8b9717c8398bb2e
msgid ""
"As with active weathervaning, using the forward motor is only enabled in "
"position controlled VTOL modes. This means it is not enabled in QSTABILIZE "
"or QHOVER flight modes. It is available in QLOITER, QRTL, QLAND and in AUTO "
"mode when executing VTOL flight commands."
msgstr ""
"与主动风标效应一样，使用前向电机仅在位置控制的 VTOL 模式下启用。这意味着在 QSTABILIZE 或 QHOVER 飞行模式下不启用。在 "
"QLOITER、QRTL、QLAND 以及执行 VTOL 飞行指令的 AUTO 模式下可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:119
#: a1c709eefe9e42b38345372200afc108
msgid "New Method (Q_FWD_THR_GAIN)"
msgstr "新方法（Q_FWD_THR_GAIN）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:121
#: 428948f227554c4caac950175b7dfbb7
msgid ""
"This method uses the position controller to control the forward motor thrust"
" in combination with the navigation pitch angle which can be limited by the "
":ref:`Q_FWD_PIT_LIM<Q_FWD_PIT_LIM>`."
msgstr ""
"此方法使用位置控制器来控制前向电机推力，并结合导航俯仰角，该俯仰角可由 :ref:`Q_FWD_PIT_LIM<Q_FWD_PIT_LIM>` 限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:123
#: 3557ae02cc0d41b6a892352b96e8d586
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_FWD_THR_GAIN<Q_FWD_THR_GAIN>` parameter sets the gain from "
"forward accel/tilt to forward throttle in Q modes. The Q modes this feature "
"operates in is controlled by the :ref:`Q_FWD_THR_USE<Q_FWD_THR_USE>` "
"parameter. Vehicles using separate forward thrust motors, eg quadplanes, "
"should set this parameter to (all up weight) / (maximum combined thrust of "
"forward motors) with a value of 2 being typical. Vehicles that tilt lifting "
"rotors to provide forward thrust should set this parameter to (all up "
"weight) / (weight lifted by tilting rotors) which for most aircraft can be "
"approximated as (total number of lifting rotors) / (number of lifting rotors"
" that tilt). When using this method of forward throttle control, the forward"
" tilt angle limit is controlled by the :ref:`Q_FWD_PIT_LIM<Q_FWD_PIT_LIM>` "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_FWD_THR_GAIN<Q_FWD_THR_GAIN>` 参数设置在 Q 模式下从前向加速度/倾斜到前向油门的增益。该功能在哪些 Q "
"模式下工作由 :ref:`Q_FWD_THR_USE<Q_FWD_THR_USE>` "
"参数控制。使用独立前向推力电机的飞机（如四旋翼飞机）应将此参数设为（全重）/（所有前向电机的最大组合推力），典型值为 "
"2。倾斜升力旋翼以提供前向推力的飞机应将此参数设为（全重）/（倾斜旋翼所承担的重量），对于大多数飞机，可近似为（升力旋翼总数）/（可倾斜的升力旋翼数）。使用此前向油门控制方法时，前向倾斜角度限制由"
" :ref:`Q_FWD_PIT_LIM<Q_FWD_PIT_LIM>` 参数控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:125
#: 86fe19bc12e54d17b5bc03e591327429
msgid ""
"this use of forward motor can be disabled using an RC switch whose "
"``RCx_OPTIONS`` param has been set to \"176\" and the switch is moved to mid"
" or low position."
msgstr "可通过将 ``RCx_OPTIONS`` 参数设为 「176」 的 RC 开关（拨到中间或低位）来禁用前向电机的使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:127
#: 3469cc446ba84a6299fb3bc5159ef5fb
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_VFWD_ALT<Q_VFWD_ALT>`: when below this relative to home altitude, "
"forward motor assist is disabled. This can be useful to keep the motor "
"propeller from hitting the ground. Rangefinder height data is used when "
"available."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_VFWD_ALT<Q_VFWD_ALT>`：当飞机低于相对 Home "
"点的此高度时，禁用前向电机辅助。这有助于防止电机螺旋桨碰触地面。当测距仪数据可用时将优先使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:130
#: af861ce980c640efa53ce5f37d0628da
msgid ""
"Continuous tilt-rotor QuadPlanes will tilt motors up to "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` times :ref:`Q_TILT_MAX<Q_TILT_MAX>` to "
"maintain position."
msgstr ""
"连续倾转旋翼 QuadPlane 将把电机倾转到 :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 乘以 "
":ref:`Q_TILT_MAX<Q_TILT_MAX>` 的角度以保持位置。"
